@startuml UC-70
' Use case: ../use-cases/UC-70.md
title UC-70: New Customers
footer Feature DASH-04 | Business rules: BR-07, BR-40
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Admin" as U
participant "Daisy.Mvc" as MVC
participant "Admin/DashboardController" as API <<Daisy.Api>>
participant "DashboardService" as SVC <<Daisy.Application>>
database "DaisyDbContext" as DB <<SQL Server>>

note over API : Requires role: Admin

U -> MVC : Choose period and grouping (day / month)
MVC -> API : GET /api/admin/dashboard/new-customers?from={from}&to={to}&groupBy={day|month}
API -> SVC : GetNewCustomersAsync(from, to, groupBy)
SVC -> DB : COUNT(*) of users WHERE Role = Customer\nAND CreatedAt in period GROUP BY day/month (BR-40)
DB --> SVC : Aggregated rows
SVC -> SVC : Fill missing periods with zero
SVC --> API : NewCustomerPointDto[]
API --> MVC : 200 OK
MVC --> U : Show chart and table

@enduml
